WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:02.150
George: From calorie
count to portion sizes,

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.970
we wanted to find out all the differences

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:06.530
between Kit Kats in Japan and the US.

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:08.747
This is "Food Wars."

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.980
In Japan, our Kit Kats come in four sizes,

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:14.563
big little pouch bite,

00:00:14.563 --> 00:00:15.729
minis,

00:00:15.729 --> 00:00:16.770
and bar,

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:18.940
and classy one, Sublime.

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:21.590
So, one thing to note
here regarding mini sizes,

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:24.400
the regular Kit Kat is 11.6 grams,

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.447
but the flavored minis, such as matcha,

00:00:27.447 --> 00:00:30.720
are said to be slightly
smaller, 11.3 grams.

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.610
So I'm going to weigh them now to confirm.

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:36.160
So, let's weigh a
regular-flavor Kit Kat first.

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:38.060
It weighs 11 grams.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:39.930
But it doesn't show the decimal points,

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:41.700
it says just 11 grams.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.730
Let's weigh matcha flavor.

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:45.563
12.

00:00:45.563 --> 00:00:47.850
It's actually heavier than regular flavor.

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:48.760
Interesting.

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:51.421
Japanese Kit Kats have become
popular all around the world,

00:00:51.421 --> 00:00:53.750
and the US, of course, is no exception.

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:54.960
I just want to mention at the top here,

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:56.120
we're going to be talking about Kit Kats

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:57.640
that are native to our countries.

00:00:57.640 --> 00:00:58.930
I know you can get them online.

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:01.140
I think Walmart.com has some of them.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.450
Fantastic. They're imported.
We know. Thank you.

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:06.460
In the US, our Kit Kats
come in nine sizes.

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:07.950
Starting from the smallest,

00:01:07.950 --> 00:01:10.900
we have a Kit Kat minis unwrapped,

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:12.283
then the thins,

00:01:12.283 --> 00:01:13.291
miniatures,

00:01:13.291 --> 00:01:14.200
snack size,

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:15.575
standard four finger,

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:16.891
the Big Kat.

00:01:16.891 --> 00:01:20.240
From there, we move up
to king size, which is,

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:21.650
a piece accidentally broke off

00:01:21.650 --> 00:01:23.390
and then I accidentally ate it.

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:25.020
The Big Kat king size.

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:27.010
So it looks like it's just two Big Kats.

00:01:27.010 --> 00:01:29.716
And the biggest size, the XL.

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:35.480
A bag of Kit Kat bites
should have 11 bites.

00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:37.419
Let's count in Japanese.

00:01:37.419 --> 00:01:40.035
Ichi, ni, san, shi, go,

00:01:40.035 --> 00:01:42.501
roku, shichi, hachi, ku, juu,

00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:43.954
juuichi.

00:01:43.954 --> 00:01:45.070
11 bites.

00:01:45.070 --> 00:01:46.720
And according to the bag,

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:49.040
the combined weight should be 50 grams.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:51.176
So let's weigh all 11 bites.

00:01:51.176 --> 00:01:52.081
Ooh!

00:01:52.081 --> 00:01:54.770
It weighs 52 grams.

00:01:54.770 --> 00:01:56.050
Good deal.

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:58.680
All of our US sizes come
in a variety of units,

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:00.520
depending on your Kit Kat needs.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:01.660
So many varieties.

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:02.970
Here's a few worth mentioning.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:05.900
The minis. The biggest
bag of minis unwrapped

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:08.360
you can get is 419 grams.

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:10.189
As the title implies,

00:02:10.189 --> 00:02:12.230
these things are unwrapped little bites.

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:14.080
It's sold like it's for
sharing, but get real.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:16.480
Whoever sticks their hand in
here first, it's their bag.

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:18.140
For the miniatures, according to Amazon,

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:20.320
you can get up to 4-pound bags,

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:25.280
aka 1,814.37 grams.

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:27.710
And what it looks like, they just sent me

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:31.930
a bag that's loosely 4
pounds of Kit Kat minis.

00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:34.290
All the bars have their various packs.

00:02:34.290 --> 00:02:35.640
None of them seem unusual.

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:37.631
I will, however, mention that

00:02:37.631 --> 00:02:40.906
the biggest single purchase
of a Kit Kat item you can get

00:02:40.906 --> 00:02:43.130
is the king-size 24-pack.

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:45.640
The total here is 2,040 grams,

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:49.982
about 4.5 pounds of Kit Kat.

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:54.430
Here's all the Kit Kats
exclusive to the US.

00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:57.297
And here is all the Kit
Kats native to Japan.

00:02:57.297 --> 00:02:59.657
Kit Kat in Japan is made by Nestlé

00:02:59.657 --> 00:03:02.400
and is one of the best-selling
candies in the country.

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:04.190
One of the reasons for its popularity

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:07.080
is that Kit Kat has a
good-luck charm in Japan

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:10.866
because the name Kit Kat
in Japanese is Kitto Katto.

00:03:10.866 --> 00:03:13.700
And Kitto Katto sounds like "kitto katsu,"

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:16.170
which means "you will surely win."

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:19.330
So the Kit Kat brand became
associated with good luck.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:21.630
And these Kit Kats are
often given to students

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:23.100
before their exams.

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:24.470
For the past 20 years,

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:28.020
Kit Kat has introduced more
than 350 unique flavors.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:28.853
Wow!

00:03:28.853 --> 00:03:31.420
Some of them are
discontinued, unfortunately,

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.290
