and it is very popular souvenir of Tokyo.

00:11:07.788 --> 00:11:11.081
And they turn into Kit Kats.

00:11:11.081 --> 00:11:13.306
Ta-da! Ooh!

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:16.693
It's gross.

00:11:16.693 --> 00:11:19.320
When you come to Tokyo, you
should try Tokyo bananas,

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:22.420
but you should not try
Tokyo banana Kit Kats.

00:11:22.420 --> 00:11:24.380
Rum raisin.

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:26.130
It's from Tokyo.

00:11:26.130 --> 00:11:28.430
Tokyo is not famous for rum raisin.

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:31.080
But it says, "Rum raisin's gorgeousness

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:34.087
and fanciness matches the image of Tokyo."

00:11:40.097 --> 00:11:42.107
There is a shot of rum.

00:11:42.107 --> 00:11:42.940
I don't like it!

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:44.823
It contains a lot of alcohol.

00:11:44.823 --> 00:11:46.163
Ooh.

00:11:46.163 --> 00:11:47.420
Nande?

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:48.253
Last one!

00:11:48.253 --> 00:11:49.661
Sake flavor,

00:11:49.661 --> 00:11:53.110
which is a Japanese traditional
alcohol made from rice.

00:11:53.110 --> 00:11:54.760
This is a really interesting one.

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:57.580
Oh.

00:11:57.580 --> 00:11:58.830
Personally, I like it.

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:01.330
And this is an acquired taste.

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:03.370
So, when it comes to sake flavor,

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:07.310
we were supposed to have
yogurt sake, yuzu sake,

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:10.220
limited-edition Japan sake umeshu,

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:13.140
but these were not available
at the time of filming this.

00:12:13.140 --> 00:12:16.420
And we have Kit Kat desserts.

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:18.140
We have Kit Kat Colliders,

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:19.570
which I could not find
at the filming of this,

00:12:19.570 --> 00:12:22.190
but it looks to be almost
like vanilla-flavored cups

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:25.140
with Kit Kat chunks broken up in it.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:27.660
Oh, man, I ate too many Kit Kats.

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:29.360
And then we have these.

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:31.903
These Kit Kat ice cream cones.

00:12:32.992 --> 00:12:33.825
Eh.

00:12:33.825 --> 00:12:36.230
I hit a wall real hard.

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:39.950
I hit a giant Kit Kat XL wall,

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:42.343
and I officially do not
want to do this anymore.

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:45.220
Better, but not by much more.

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:47.320
Yeah, so that's it for the US.

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:49.140
Sorry we have so few flavors.

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:51.982
Japan has a Kit Kat called Otona no Amasa,

00:12:51.982 --> 00:12:55.887
which translates to
"sweetness for adults."

00:12:55.887 --> 00:12:58.980
Ow! R-rated!

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:01.420
Don't let your kids watch this part!

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:03.720
All right, so it's a
line of Kit Kat flavors

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:05.000
that are a little more bitter

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:07.110
and less sweet than regular Kit Kats.

00:13:07.110 --> 00:13:10.520
So, here we have Otona
no Amasa strawberry,

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:11.970
white,

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:14.030
and dark matcha

00:13:14.030 --> 00:13:15.590
and dark chocolate.

00:13:15.590 --> 00:13:16.680
All right, so let's give it a try.

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:17.513
First.

00:13:17.513 --> 00:13:19.430
This is just straight-up dark chocolate,

00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:20.263
as you can imagine.

00:13:20.263 --> 00:13:21.678
Strawberry.

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:24.980
Ooh, it's actually tart.

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:25.813
This is good.

00:13:25.813 --> 00:13:27.460
All right, so let's
move on to the next one.

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:29.304
We've got dark matcha.

00:13:29.304 --> 00:13:30.787
Mm.

00:13:30.787 --> 00:13:32.487
This is so deep.

00:13:32.487 --> 00:13:35.437
Much deeper than the other matcha flavors.

00:13:35.437 --> 00:13:39.712
So, last one, we've got Otona
no Amasa white chocolate.

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:42.780
This is the best one

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:45.330
among these Otona no Amasa chocolates.

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:47.740
Just right sweetness.

00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:51.830
All right, so let's do matcha taste test.

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:55.630
In Japan, matcha-flavored
Kit Kats are so popular.

00:13:55.630 --> 00:13:58.892
Over the years, we've
introduced 13 different,

00:13:58.892 --> 00:14:01.220
different, different,
different matcha flavors.

00:14:01.220 --> 00:14:04.460
But currently, we were only
able to get these three.

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:06.970
So let's see how different they are.

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:08.458
First, dark matcha.

00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:10.865
Deep matcha.

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:12.868
But it's also deep.

00:14:12.868 --> 00:14:15.035
Ito Kyuemon Uji matcha.

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:18.720
So freaking hard to tell the difference.

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:22.215
But I'd say this one is
the most delicious one.

00:14:22.215 --> 00:14:23.681
Kyoto.

00:14:23.681 --> 00:14:26.864
You can get it in Kyoto or order online.

00:14:26.864 --> 00:14:30.630
So, here we have classy
chocolates called Sublime.

00:14:30.630 --> 00:14:33.080
So we have white Sublime

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:35.113
and raw milk Sublime

00:14:35.113 --> 00:14:37.570
and a volcanic green Sublime

00:14:37.570 --> 00:14:40.211
and orange volcanic Sublime,

00:14:40.211 --> 00:14:41.127
yellow,

00:14:41.127 --> 00:14:42.418
ruby Sublime.

00:14:42.418 --> 00:14:44.200
All right, so let's try some out.

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:46.699
I'm getting sick of the sweetness.

00:14:46.699 --> 00:14:47.757
Itadakimasu.

00:14:51.623 --> 00:14:53.139
It doesn't taste anything!

00:14:53.139 --> 00:14:55.610
I was thinking that it'd
taste like strawberry

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:57.403
or raspberry or something, but.

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:00.149
Did I get COVID?

00:15:00.149 --> 00:15:01.460
COVID-19?

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:03.030
OK, let's keep going.

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:05.530
All right, so I'm going
to go yellow volcanic.

00:15:05.530 --> 00:15:07.753
Volcano! Pew!

00:15:09.118 --> 00:15:10.276
Ooh!

00:15:10.276 --> 00:15:12.360
This is the bitterest.

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:14.098
I've got orange.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:18.820
Bitter.

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:20.010
Now I'm so scared.

00:15:20.010 --> 00:15:21.733
Green Sublime.

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:27.210
It tastes exactly same
as these two. So bitter.

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:29.763
Next we have milk Sublime.

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:34.340
It tastes exactly the
same as regular flavor.

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:35.580
I prefer this one.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:37.883
Last one, I've got white Sublime.

00:15:40.570 --> 00:15:44.200
Compared to the Otona no
Amasa white chocolate,

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:45.320
it's much better.

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:46.153
I'm done.

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:48.280
Hey, guys, it's Harry.

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:49.890
I can't let you do a Kit
Kat episode without me,

00:15:49.890 --> 00:15:52.970
because Kit Kats were actually
invented in the UK in 1935.

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:54.710
They would eventually
be distributed by Nestlé

00:15:54.710 --> 00:15:56.880
across the UK, the EU, and Japan.

00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:58.200
But in the US, Kit Kats are made

00:15:58.200 --> 00:15:59.750
and distributed by Hershey's.

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:01.200
If you watched our Snickers episode,

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:02.960
you'll know that there are
some major taste differences

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:05.030
between the chocolate
in the UK and the US.

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:06.930
Mostly that the UK's is way better.

00:16:06.930 --> 00:16:08.100
I'm going to do a three-way taste test

00:16:08.100 --> 00:16:10.840
between UK, US, and
also a Japanese Kit Kat

00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:12.873
to see if there's any major
differences between the three.

00:16:12.873 --> 00:16:15.780
And, Harry, thank you for sending me this

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:17.410
with your cute handwriting.

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:19.571
Thank you, Harry! Arigato.

00:16:19.571 --> 00:16:21.688
Let's try UK Kit Kat first.

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:25.780
The UK one is obviously
the one I'm used to.

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:27.140
The chocolate is very smooth,

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:29.620
not overwhelmingly sweet,
and just very tasty.

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:31.620
The UK is already a lot richer.

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:35.110
OK, OK.

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:36.700
Can I try US Kit Kat?

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:37.560
I also couldn't find

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:39.240
just a standard American Kit Kat anywhere.

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:41.510
I guess we didn't bother
importing the regular one.

00:16:41.510 --> 00:16:42.570
The closest thing I could find

00:16:42.570 --> 00:16:44.883
was this Kit Kat Duos
mocha and chocolate one.

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:49.410
Something doesn't taste
quite right about that.

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:50.243
Yep.

00:16:50.243 --> 00:16:52.130
UK, US,

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:53.460
they suck.

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:55.950
They both have too much sugar.

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:58.793
Joe, Harry, try Japan's Kit Kat.

00:16:59.918 --> 00:17:00.751
Mm.

00:17:00.751 --> 00:17:02.370
Much smoother. Creamier.

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:03.370
In terms of picking a favorite,

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:05.560
I think the US one gets
discounted immediately.

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:07.150
Then, between the UK and the Japan one,

00:17:07.150 --> 00:17:09.450
it's kind of a different
style of Kit Kat, I guess.

00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:11.450
I would say Japan and UK
are pretty neck and neck.

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:12.430
They seem very similar.

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:15.547
Japan's Kit Kat is the best in the world.

00:17:15.547 --> 00:17:17.449
Ugh, I've eaten too much candy.

00:17:17.449 --> 00:17:18.540
Ugh!

00:17:18.540 --> 00:17:20.280
Perhaps we can pinpoint
the taste difference

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:21.113
to the ingredients.

00:17:21.113 --> 00:17:22.796
In the US, a Kit Kat is made up of

00:17:22.796 --> 00:17:24.312
sugar, wheat flour --

00:17:24.312 --> 00:17:25.145
[beep]

00:17:27.048 --> 00:17:27.881
[beep]

00:17:27.881 --> 00:17:29.756
Our Kit Kats have the following.

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:32.860
Looking over the ingredients,

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:35.320
I noticed our Kit Kats have
cocoa butter and chocolate,

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:36.660
although it does not specify

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:38.220
what that chocolate is made up of.

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:39.386
Do we assume it is the same

00:17:39.386 --> 00:17:40.620
as the Hershey's chocolate bar?

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:41.453
I don't know.

00:17:41.453 --> 00:17:43.670
Whereas the Japan Kit Kat has cocoa mass,

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:46.490
cocoa butter, and cocoa powder.

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:48.880
Now, if we're to believe
that Nestlé in Japan

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.390
holds their chocolate
to the same standards

00:17:50.390 --> 00:17:51.740
they do in the UK, it would mean

00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:54.190
that it would have a higher
fat and cocoa content.

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:56.040
According to the UK rules,

00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:59.140
"a product must contain no
less than 25% cocoa solids

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:01.240
to be considered 'milk chocolate.'"

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:03.640
The US definitely does
not go by this rule.

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:05.690
Our Kit Kat is made up of palm oil,

00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:08.030
where theirs is vegetable
oil. Same in the UK.

00:18:08.030 --> 00:18:10.390
It is cheaper, but it's also
worse on the environment,

00:18:10.390 --> 00:18:11.731
adding to deforestation,

00:18:11.731 --> 00:18:13.206
increasing greenhouse [gas] emissions,

00:18:13.206 --> 00:18:14.670
and water pollution.

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:17.510
So it is bad on the
environment and tastes worse.

00:18:17.510 --> 00:18:18.630
Fantastic.

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:21.080
But good news for all you vegans,

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:23.560
Nestlé has created a vegan Kit Kat,

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:27.270
with substituted milk with
a rice-based alternative,

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:29.610
but availability is currently limited,

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:32.573
so they are not available
in the US or Japan.

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:36.620
This is a US Kit Kat miniature,

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:38.519
and it is 8.5 grams.

00:18:38.519 --> 00:18:40.680
It's the closest size
we had to Japan's mini.

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:42.288
This is 42 calories,

00:18:42.288 --> 00:18:43.970
2.2 grams of fat,

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:45.578
6 milligrams of sodium,

00:18:45.578 --> 00:18:47.150
5.8 grams of carbs,

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:48.650
4 of those are sugar,

00:18:48.650 --> 00:18:50.641
and 1 gram of protein.

00:18:50.641 --> 00:18:53.543
In Japan, the mini is
the most popular size.

00:18:53.543 --> 00:18:55.376
It's 62 calories

00:18:55.376 --> 00:18:57.476
and 3.5 grams of fat,

00:18:57.476 --> 00:19:01.060
3.5 to 11.4 milligrams of sodium,

00:19:01.060 --> 00:19:04.993
8.99 to 19.4 grams of total carbs,

00:19:04.993 --> 00:19:07.734
and 0.9 grams of protein.

00:19:07.734 --> 00:19:10.000
The most common Kit Kat size in the US

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.670
is the four-finger bar.

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:13.270
210 calories,

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:14.311
11 grams of fat,

00:19:14.311 --> 00:19:15.600
7 of those are saturated,

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:17.400
20 milligrams of sodium,

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:18.710
28 grams of carbs,

00:19:18.710 --> 00:19:20.360
23 of those are sugar,

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:21.793
and 2 grams of protein.

00:19:21.793 --> 00:19:24.100
The closest size we have to that in Japan

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:25.540
is the Kit Kat bar.

00:19:25.540 --> 00:19:28.260
It contains 224 calories.

00:19:28.260 --> 00:19:30.140
The most caloried Kit Kat in the US we got

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:31.730
is the Kit Kat XL.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:33.288
Now, I unwrapped it here so you could see

00:19:33.288 --> 00:19:34.479
just how big it is.

00:19:34.479 --> 00:19:36.760
It contains 640 calories.

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:39.970
The most calories you will
get in a Kit Kat in Japan

00:19:39.970 --> 00:19:41.680
is the big little pouch bite.

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:44.603
This bag is 275 calories.

